<section class="gg-home-hero">
  <div class="gg-bg-mesh"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-home-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-home-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower App</span>
      <h1>A garden for the life you're trying to build.</h1>
      <p>
        Every goal becomes a plant. Every action helps it grow. Build meaningful
        habits, return after imperfect days, and watch your progress come to life.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#runthrough" class="gg-btn-soft">Watch Runthrough</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-phone-scene reveal">
      <div class="gg-float-card float-one">
        <strong>24</strong>
        <span>Goals watered</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-float-card float-two">
        <strong>7</strong>
        <span>Days returned</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-phone-frame hero-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '1000x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-phone-frame mini-hero-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker small"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goals list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-belief-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-glass-panel reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The feeling</span>
      <h2>Progress should feel like care, not pressure.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is built for real life — fresh starts, slow growth, shared
        encouragement, and small daily actions that quietly change who you become.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-flow-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">How it works</span>
      <h2>Your goals become something you can see.</h2>
      <p>No overlapping cards. Just a smooth, clear journey through the app.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-flow-cards">
      <article class="gg-flow-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-flow-copy">
          <span>01 / Create</span>
          <h3>Start with intention.</h3>
          <p>Create a goal with a reason strong enough to return to.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone-frame flow-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Create goal screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-flow-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-flow-copy">
          <span>02 / Place</span>
          <h3>Give it a home.</h3>
          <p>Your goal becomes part of a garden instead of disappearing into a list.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone-frame flow-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-flow-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-flow-copy">
          <span>03 / Grow</span>
          <h3>Track the growth.</h3>
          <p>See the details, progress, and actions behind every plant.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone-frame flow-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-video-section" id="runthrough">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">App runthrough</span>
      <h2>See the garden system in motion.</h2>
      <p>
        The runthrough shows the real app experience: creating goals, viewing
        progress, and moving through the garden.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-video-shell reveal">
      <video
        src="{{ 'Screen_Recording_goal-grower-runthrough.mp4' | asset_url }}"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
      ></video>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-screens-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Screenshots</span>
      <h2>Real app screens, shown clearly.</h2>
      <p>Each screenshot has a purpose in the story.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-screen-grid">
      <div class="gg-screen-item reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-frame gallery-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals yet screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Start fresh</h3>
        <p>Begin with a clean space.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-screen-item reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-frame gallery-phone featured-gallery-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-add-goal-saving-read-more-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Add goal screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Create clearly</h3>
        <p>Turn intention into a goal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-screen-item reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-frame gallery-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>See growth</h3>
        <p>Watch progress become visible.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-screen-item reveal">
        <div class="gg-phone-frame gallery-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Track details</h3>
        <p>Keep the goal grounded.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-shared-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-shared-card reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-kicker">Shared gardens</span>
        <h2>Grow with people who are growing too.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Create shared gardens with friends, spouses, classmates, roommates, or
          accountability partners. Everyone works on their own goals while
          contributing to something together.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-pills">
          <span>Friends</span>
          <span>Family</span>
          <span>Classmates</span>
          <span>Partners</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-growth-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Growth loop</span>
      <h2>Small actions become visible identity.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-growth-grid">
      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Seed</span>
        <p>Create the goal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Sprout</span>
        <p>Take first action.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Plant</span>
        <p>Build consistency.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Bloom</span>
        <p>Reach milestones.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-maker-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Built by a student</span>
      <h2>Designed by someone who needed it too.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built to make progress feel less cold and more
        alive: part app, part garden, part reminder that growth takes time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-maker-card reveal">
      <h3>Current progress</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Goal tracking built</li>
        <li>Personal gardens built</li>
        <li>Shared gardens in beta</li>
        <li>Android testing next</li>
        <li>Widgets and reminders future</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-store-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support the build</span>
      <h2>Help the garden keep growing.</h2>
      <p>
        Support Goal Grower development, future apps, digital tools, and products
        made for intentional growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-grid">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-card reveal">
        <span>Main</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Help fund development, design, testing, and future features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-card reveal">
        <span>Tools</span>
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, and intentional growth resources.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-card reveal">
        <span>Objects</span>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch, desk items, and calming productivity products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final-cta gg-final-section">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

